<title>UK: GMAC sets $1.0 billion five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>GMAC sets $1.0 billion five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 APR.02</p>
